WEBVTT

00:01.337 --> 00:03.347
[LILY] I've been
at the Blue Crystals guild hall,

00:03.427 --> 00:06.017
staying in a room,
shut off from the world.

00:07.137 --> 00:09.137
The last time I stepped foot
out of that building

00:09.227 --> 00:10.307
was two years ago.

00:10.727 --> 00:12.857
You mean you were bed rotting
these last couple years?

00:12.937 --> 00:13.897
Stop judging me!

00:14.977 --> 00:17.987
And besides, you weren't there.
I can't fight anymore.

00:18.817 --> 00:20.527
Not since that day.

00:20.607 --> 00:22.947
Not only was it the first time
I failed a quest,

00:23.027 --> 00:25.237
I also nearly died
in the process.

00:26.077 --> 00:27.157
I turn into a wreck

00:27.247 --> 00:28.957
at the mere thought
of having to fight.

00:29.037 --> 00:31.247
I'm short of breath
and my hands shake.

00:31.327 --> 00:34.497
It's so bad I can't even
hold my own sword steady.

00:34.587 --> 00:36.207
But why am I telling you this?

00:36.297 --> 00:37.707
It's not like you'd understand.

00:37.797 --> 00:40.007
So, why did you tag along?

00:40.087 --> 00:41.927
I'm sure I'm steady enough
to kill you,

00:42.007 --> 00:43.597
so quit running
that mouth of yours!

00:43.677 --> 00:45.637
We're supposed
to be killing a dragon, not me.

00:45.717 --> 00:47.677
Seriously,
do you ever shut up?

00:48.427 --> 00:49.637
-Oh.
-[grunts]

00:49.727 --> 00:51.977
-What a pretty looking birdie.
-Huh?

00:54.937 --> 00:55.897
[dragon growling]

00:55.977 --> 00:59.067
[LILY] That's a dragon, moron!

00:59.897 --> 01:02.857
[♪ opening theme song playing]

02:38.577 --> 02:39.787
[Lily gasps]

02:40.417 --> 02:42.457
It keeps getting closer.

02:42.547 --> 02:44.217
You have to run.

02:44.507 --> 02:45.417
[gasps]

02:45.507 --> 02:47.337
Hey! What're you thinking?

02:47.427 --> 02:49.217
You saw for yourself
at the guild,

02:49.297 --> 02:51.097
these clothes are enchanted.

02:51.177 --> 02:53.057
A little enchantment
isn't enough

02:53.137 --> 02:55.387
-to protect you from a dragon.
-Everything's all right.

02:55.477 --> 02:58.517
For your safety,
I suggest staying behind me.

02:59.607 --> 03:00.857
[LILY] Huh?

03:02.147 --> 03:03.647
[REIN] Come on, let's go.
[chuckles]

03:03.727 --> 03:04.897
[groans]

03:04.987 --> 03:07.487
Oh, wow,
what a pretty looking birdie.

03:07.567 --> 03:09.697
Please, like I'm supposed
to trust you?

03:09.777 --> 03:10.987
I've got this, Lily.

03:11.277 --> 03:13.327
Besides, dragons aren't
as scary as everyone thinks.

03:13.407 --> 03:15.367
They aren't compared
to a lunatic like you!

03:15.447 --> 03:17.167
At least dragons
are somewhat predictable!

03:17.247 --> 03:18.287
-[dragon growls]
-[BOTH] Huh?

03:27.167 --> 03:28.797
-[gasps]
-[Rein exclaims]

03:28.887 --> 03:30.007
♪

03:34.677 --> 03:36.097
[dragon growling]

03:53.867 --> 03:55.157
[gasps]

04:05.007 --> 04:06.717
See you later, dragon.

04:06.797 --> 04:08.667
It'll circle back around.

04:08.757 --> 04:10.797
So, why aren't you
a pile of ash right now?

04:10.887 --> 04:13.257
I blocked the flames
with my clothing.

04:13.347 --> 04:15.927
There's not a whole lot
that can get past my duds.

04:16.017 --> 04:17.017
[Lily gasps softly]

04:17.557 --> 04:19.267
As far as attacking goes,

04:19.347 --> 04:20.977
I don't think
it'll be all that difficult

04:21.057 --> 04:22.147
to bring it down.

04:22.227 --> 04:23.397
I have this!

04:23.477 --> 04:25.477
[gasps] So dinky.

04:25.567 --> 04:26.527
[dragon growls]

04:27.357 --> 04:28.567
[REIN] Don't be scared.

04:29.397 --> 04:33.067
Foul beast, be gone. [grunts]

04:35.867 --> 04:37.287
That's weird.

04:39.867 --> 04:41.537
[Lily breathes shakily]

04:41.627 --> 04:43.377
Even at such a crucial time,

04:43.457 --> 04:46.417
my hand's trembling so badly,
I can't hold onto my sword.

04:47.087 --> 04:48.837
If I wasn't so afraid,

04:49.377 --> 04:51.587
I could easily
defeat this dragon.

04:51.677 --> 04:54.847
Sorry, I didn't mean
to make you anxious.

04:54.927 --> 04:57.307
I'll be shielded
from its attacks long enough

04:57.387 --> 04:59.557
to land a direct blow somehow.

04:59.637 --> 05:01.347
You think so?

05:01.437 --> 05:03.477
Why is a clueless
amateur like you

05:03.557 --> 05:05.227
trying so hard to show off?

05:06.147 --> 05:07.857
I know myself,

05:08.357 --> 05:10.197
and I'm better than this.

05:12.397 --> 05:14.867
I should be able to do anything.

05:14.947 --> 05:15.907
Are you nuts?

05:16.327 --> 05:18.497
It's gonna keep its distance
while dodging you!

05:18.577 --> 05:19.947
Let it get closer!

05:20.037 --> 05:21.657
Be patient and wait
for the right moment to strike!

05:21.747 --> 05:23.247
Uh, got it.

05:23.327 --> 05:25.537
You better make sure
you don't miss this time!

05:25.627 --> 05:27.457
You've only got one block left,

05:27.547 --> 05:29.547
then your armor
is literally toast!

05:30.167 --> 05:31.837
Wanna get killed
on your first quest

05:31.927 --> 05:33.387
as an adventurer?

05:33.467 --> 05:35.837
No, I think my clothes
will survive,

05:35.927 --> 05:37.507
but I'll do like you said.

05:37.597 --> 05:39.847
[dragon growls]

05:42.977 --> 05:44.187
Strike now!

05:44.267 --> 05:46.897
[Rein yelling]

05:51.607 --> 05:52.987
♪

06:03.707 --> 06:04.827
[LILY] Uh?

06:06.827 --> 06:08.877
Utter insanity.

06:08.957 --> 06:12.127
And a total success, Lily.
Thanks to you.

06:13.047 --> 06:15.137
[LILY] Uh, you're welcome.

06:15.757 --> 06:19.557
[REIN] I defeated a dragon
with a copper sword.

06:19.637 --> 06:21.557
I guess I really can fight.

06:22.017 --> 06:22.927
Uh?

06:23.477 --> 06:25.807
As expected,
it doesn't make a difference

06:25.887 --> 06:27.187
if you enhance the attack.

06:27.267 --> 06:29.687
It doesn't enhance
the durability.

06:29.767 --> 06:30.937
[gasps]

06:31.027 --> 06:33.027
Now how about that?
My clothes, too!

06:33.107 --> 06:35.027
Obviously, the expert knows
more than me.

06:35.107 --> 06:36.947
That was the last time they were
gonna block out the flames!

06:37.027 --> 06:38.407
Stay away, perv!

06:38.487 --> 06:40.077
[Rein groans]

06:43.537 --> 06:45.247
[Rein groans]

06:48.827 --> 06:51.457
-[grunts]
-Stop going back to sleep!

06:52.087 --> 06:53.007
Lily.

06:53.087 --> 06:54.257
Huh?

06:55.507 --> 06:59.257
[REIN] What I'm about to say,
it's me talking in my sleep,

06:59.347 --> 07:01.507
so it might sound like nonsense.

07:02.217 --> 07:05.687
You said if I died trying to
slay the dragon by myself,

07:05.767 --> 07:09.017
the Blue Crystals would be
criticized into oblivion, right?

07:09.107 --> 07:12.147
Sure. Maybe I did.

07:12.227 --> 07:15.027
But if you came along, too,
and it turned out

07:15.107 --> 07:17.107
the pro and the newbie
were both burned up,

07:17.197 --> 07:18.867
people wouldn't assume
the worst.

07:18.947 --> 07:21.657
They'd just think the dragon
we faced was really strong.

07:22.327 --> 07:23.407
♪

07:24.247 --> 07:26.157
In the end,
the Blue Crystals

07:26.247 --> 07:28.377
would have been protected
from criticism.

07:28.827 --> 07:31.497
No one could blame them
for what ended up happening.

07:31.877 --> 07:33.587
Since you're convinced
you can't fight,

07:33.667 --> 07:34.877
I kind of get the feeling

07:34.957 --> 07:36.467
you thought the only way
you could be useful

07:36.547 --> 07:38.087
was by throwing your life away.

07:38.177 --> 07:40.677
If I'm way off base here,
go ahead and ignore me.

07:40.757 --> 07:42.467
♪

07:42.557 --> 07:44.767
But if I'm not, you should know,

07:44.847 --> 07:47.977
the Blue Crystals would
never wish for that to happen.

07:48.057 --> 07:50.437
Whatever people would've said
about the guild,

07:50.517 --> 07:52.977
I guarantee...
sacrificing yourself

07:53.067 --> 07:55.277
would've made Elsie and Nina
way sadder.

07:57.737 --> 07:59.607
I wondered what you
were going to say.

07:59.697 --> 08:01.947
I should have guessed
it would be a bunch of nonsense.

08:02.567 --> 08:03.737
Yeah.

08:03.827 --> 08:05.117
♪

08:06.997 --> 08:09.157
[LILY] The Blue Crystals
took me in

08:09.247 --> 08:12.537
when I was completely worthless
and unable to fight.

08:12.627 --> 08:14.667
So today, I...

08:15.257 --> 08:17.207
I thought that maybe...

08:17.297 --> 08:19.967
maybe if I could...

08:21.757 --> 08:22.757
I kept telling myself

08:23.177 --> 08:25.217
this was the only way
I could repay them. [cries]

08:25.887 --> 08:27.267
I'm sorry.

08:27.347 --> 08:28.437
[Rein gasps]

08:29.137 --> 08:30.227
Good.

08:30.977 --> 08:32.017
Just wait.

08:32.607 --> 08:35.267
I swear, one day soon, I'm gonna
be useful in a fight again,

08:35.357 --> 08:36.857
which means...

08:37.317 --> 08:41.277
you better keep quiet
or you'll be my first opponent.

08:41.357 --> 08:43.577
-[cries]
-[chuckles] Okay. Sure.

08:48.197 --> 08:49.327
[Lily sniffles]

08:49.407 --> 08:50.867
[yawns]

08:50.957 --> 08:52.037
Your boobs and thighs

08:52.127 --> 08:53.707
are 10 out of 10
on the softness scale,

08:53.787 --> 08:55.377
-so congrats, buddy!
-[yelps]

08:55.457 --> 08:57.707
You didn't touch my boobs,
so how would you know?

08:57.797 --> 09:00.007
And don't blame it on talking
in your sleep again, jerk!

09:00.087 --> 09:01.377
[both screaming]

09:04.547 --> 09:06.597
[REIN] Lily, it doesn't make
a difference

09:06.677 --> 09:08.637
how much I enhance
swords and armor.

09:08.727 --> 09:11.807
What I need is
actual combat experience.

09:14.437 --> 09:15.857
So how about it?

09:15.937 --> 09:18.317
You wanna keep
adventuring with me?

09:19.437 --> 09:21.067
I need you by my side.

09:21.147 --> 09:23.157
I can't do this without you.

09:26.947 --> 09:28.157
[Lily cries]

09:28.537 --> 09:30.287
I'm looking forward to it.

09:33.787 --> 09:35.877
[ELSIE] Well, well, well...

09:35.957 --> 09:37.797
Seems like I was worried
over nothing

09:37.877 --> 09:39.337
and didn't need
to keep an eye on them.

09:39.417 --> 09:40.547
Elsie, out.

09:42.467 --> 09:44.507
[REIN] Whoa!
Look at those numbers!

09:44.587 --> 09:47.257
That mid-level dragon
gave me 700 points!

09:47.347 --> 09:49.257
That was fun! What do you think,

09:49.347 --> 09:51.387
should we taxidermy the body
or something?

09:51.477 --> 09:53.637
Let a dissector handle the work
from here on out.

09:53.727 --> 09:55.187
That's so brilliant!

09:55.267 --> 09:56.687
Let's run back
and let them know...

09:56.767 --> 09:58.437
[LILY] We can't. It'll be night

09:58.517 --> 09:59.977
-before we get back.
-Why not, Lily? Come on.

10:00.067 --> 10:01.687
-I brought what we needed.
-Come on. We can make it!

10:01.777 --> 10:03.647
-Let's camp out here somewhere.
-Believe in yourself! Please?

10:05.027 --> 10:06.527
[REIN] Whoa!

10:06.617 --> 10:09.277
Real fire!
It burns and everything!

10:09.867 --> 10:13.577
[LILY] Why is he always acting
like it's his first day alive?

10:13.657 --> 10:16.747
For real, though, I'm happy
that I got to be an adventurer.

10:16.837 --> 10:19.127
I've never had this much fun.

10:19.207 --> 10:21.797
So that's why
you're the way you are.

10:22.257 --> 10:23.467
[REIN] Why what?

10:23.837 --> 10:25.257
[LILY] It's not important.

10:26.337 --> 10:27.467
[Lily gasps]

10:27.547 --> 10:29.507
-[REIN] What's wrong?
-[Lily exhales]

10:30.847 --> 10:31.887
♪

10:31.977 --> 10:33.267
Someone is coming.

10:34.227 --> 10:37.307
Four. Scratch that. Make it six.

10:37.397 --> 10:38.477
-[exclaims] Oh?
-Here.

10:38.557 --> 10:40.727
Ooh... Say, that's
a nice spyglass!

10:40.817 --> 10:43.027
Look through it, you dummy!
Not at it!

10:43.107 --> 10:44.527
[REIN] Huh?

10:46.027 --> 10:47.907
I recognize those guys.

10:48.447 --> 10:50.447
They're Beast's Fangs
adventurers.

10:50.527 --> 10:54.367
What? I knew something
would go wrong before morning.

10:54.457 --> 10:56.577
I haven't seen them in forever.

10:56.667 --> 10:58.457
And they weren't around
the day that I was thrown out

10:58.537 --> 11:00.337
-of the guild onto the street.
-Huh?

11:00.877 --> 11:02.167
[REIN] More than likely,

11:02.257 --> 11:04.797
they still believe
I'm with the Beast's Fangs.

11:04.877 --> 11:07.547
Is that so?
Then let's pretend you are

11:07.637 --> 11:09.257
and see if we can avoid
any drama.

11:09.347 --> 11:12.177
Not after what happened!
These days, I'm a member

11:12.257 --> 11:13.847
of the Blue Crystals
and proud of it!

11:13.927 --> 11:15.477
[LILY] Let me ask you something.

11:15.557 --> 11:17.897
After they figure out
you dispelled the enchantments

11:17.977 --> 11:19.687
on everyone's gear
when you were kicked out,

11:19.767 --> 11:21.227
you think it'll end well?

11:21.897 --> 11:24.437
That's a good point but... Huh?

11:25.937 --> 11:27.107
What the...

11:27.197 --> 11:29.367
How's that supposed
to help us out?

11:29.447 --> 11:30.947
[LILY] They'll realize
I'm an adventurer

11:31.027 --> 11:32.367
if I'm dressed in this outfit,

11:32.447 --> 11:34.867
so I'm going to pretend to be
a regular city girl.

11:34.947 --> 11:37.957
Oh, it was good thinking
bringing a disguise along!

11:38.037 --> 11:39.207
♪

11:41.747 --> 11:44.047
Disguise?
They're my normal clothes.

11:44.127 --> 11:45.917
How can a living legend
have zero taste?

11:52.177 --> 11:55.177
Well, if it isn't Rein.
Sure has been a while.

11:55.267 --> 11:57.347
What brings you out this far?

11:57.427 --> 11:59.437
[REIN] The third anniversary
of my dad's death.

11:59.517 --> 12:01.057
And you know how mothers are,

12:01.147 --> 12:03.187
always bugging you
to stop by and visit them.

12:03.267 --> 12:04.897
It's always the same thing
with her.

12:04.977 --> 12:06.147
"When are you getting married?

12:06.237 --> 12:07.567
When are you gonna
give me some grandkids?

12:07.647 --> 12:09.027
I'm not gonna live forever,
you know.

12:09.107 --> 12:10.697
-Stop being so selfish."
-You haven't changed.

12:10.777 --> 12:12.697
Your little friend
seems familiar.

12:12.777 --> 12:14.827
You're not Lily Flambert,
are you?

12:14.907 --> 12:16.197
[LILY] Everyone says that!

12:16.287 --> 12:18.327
Just because
I look a little bit like her.

12:18.407 --> 12:20.917
Honestly, I'm sick
of always hearing this crap!

12:20.997 --> 12:23.957
If anyone mentions Lily Flambert
one more time, I'll puke.

12:24.037 --> 12:25.207
So, no then.

12:25.297 --> 12:26.667
[REIN] Lily and I were
classmates.

12:26.757 --> 12:28.087
She's attending
the service with me!

12:29.717 --> 12:32.137
So wait a minute.
Your name's also Lily?

12:32.217 --> 12:33.967
[LILY] Uh, yeah,
that's the thing.

12:34.047 --> 12:36.007
The reason she pisses me off
so much.

12:36.097 --> 12:38.477
That Lily may be an adventurer,
but look at me.

12:38.557 --> 12:40.097
I'm just a regular city girl.

12:40.187 --> 12:42.187
And it's not like
the real Lily Flambert

12:42.267 --> 12:44.897
would be hanging around
the middle of nowhere at night.

12:44.977 --> 12:47.607
Yeah, right. I hear she cowers
under the covers

12:47.687 --> 12:48.987
and pisses herself
every day now.

12:49.067 --> 12:51.737
-Listen up.
-Uh, stop worrying about me.

12:51.817 --> 12:52.737
But he said--

12:52.817 --> 12:53.987
[CORNELIUS] Rein.

12:56.277 --> 12:58.247
Do you know who these two are?

12:58.327 --> 12:59.707
Never seen them.

12:59.787 --> 13:02.287
[CORNELIUS] We ran into a party
of useless adventurers

13:02.377 --> 13:04.587
from some other guild
while we were questing.

13:04.667 --> 13:06.547
There were three more
in their party,

13:06.627 --> 13:08.547
but they chose
to press their luck.

13:08.627 --> 13:10.047
We taught them a lesson.

13:10.127 --> 13:12.467
-Their final one, right?
-[male hostage grunts]

13:12.547 --> 13:14.347
-[whimpers]
-Yes.

13:14.427 --> 13:16.967
[REIN] Wait, do you mean
they died somehow?

13:17.057 --> 13:18.977
Look how terrified
these two are.

13:19.057 --> 13:21.137
Why don't you do the right thing
and release them?

13:21.227 --> 13:23.767
[CORNELIUS] From their
sad lives? Good idea.

13:23.857 --> 13:25.147
[grunting]

13:26.017 --> 13:28.567
I can't take any more of this!
[cries]

13:29.027 --> 13:30.067
[Cornelius chuckles]

13:31.607 --> 13:32.487
[gasps]

13:35.777 --> 13:37.367
As I thought...

13:38.367 --> 13:40.537
my bow has gotten
weaker recently.

13:41.287 --> 13:43.287
And I don't mean by a little.

13:43.367 --> 13:45.077
It's not only me.

13:45.167 --> 13:46.997
Their equipment's weaker, too.

13:47.877 --> 13:49.167
Whatever happened,

13:49.257 --> 13:52.217
it made us fail our quest
which pisses me off.

13:53.257 --> 13:55.797
Well, I guess it's not
a total waste.

13:55.887 --> 13:57.387
[groans]

14:03.057 --> 14:05.397
Believe it or not,
I'm glad we ran into you, Rein.

14:05.477 --> 14:07.687
We need you to enchant
our weapons and armor

14:07.767 --> 14:09.187
back to their normal levels.

14:09.267 --> 14:11.687
Like I ever would.
After what you--

14:11.777 --> 14:14.147
What he meant
is he's lost his ability

14:14.237 --> 14:15.817
to enchant anything.

14:15.907 --> 14:17.657
Must've misheard you.

14:17.737 --> 14:19.947
The enchanter can't enchant?

14:20.037 --> 14:21.327
Why are you even alive

14:21.407 --> 14:22.827
if you've become
absolutely useless?

14:22.907 --> 14:25.417
That's what you think, huh?
Well, turns out--

14:25.497 --> 14:26.537
That's enough.

14:26.627 --> 14:28.457
While you can't help
with their gear,

14:28.537 --> 14:30.667
the least we can do
is dig a couple of graves

14:30.757 --> 14:32.507
and bury
both the prisoners' bodies.

14:32.587 --> 14:34.047
If they're left out in the open,

14:34.127 --> 14:36.547
the smell of blood
will attract creatures.

14:36.637 --> 14:38.637
You're pretty smart for a chick.

14:38.717 --> 14:41.177
How about I bury
something inside of you?

14:41.257 --> 14:43.097
I think I'll pass.

14:44.557 --> 14:46.437
[CORNELIUS] She's got spirit.

14:46.517 --> 14:48.107
Take a page out of her book

14:48.187 --> 14:50.767
and maybe folks won't think
you're so pathetic.

14:53.647 --> 14:55.527
[REIN] Lily, I'm sorry.

14:55.987 --> 14:57.117
[LILY] For what?

14:57.407 --> 14:58.617
[REIN] I was always working
in the guild hall

14:58.697 --> 15:00.737
and never saw the outside world.
[panting]

15:00.827 --> 15:03.657
I had no idea they got up
to this sort of thing out here.

15:03.747 --> 15:05.907
I dragged you
into my business again.

15:05.997 --> 15:07.417
They're right, I'm pathetic.

15:07.497 --> 15:08.837
[LILY] It's not your fault.

15:09.877 --> 15:11.087
Are you sure?

15:11.167 --> 15:12.257
Yeah.

15:12.337 --> 15:13.917
I was a shut-in for two years.

15:14.007 --> 15:15.337
Most likely, you're more aware

15:15.417 --> 15:17.297
of how the world operates
these days than I am.

15:17.387 --> 15:19.637
[chuckles] Yeah,
you were a real hermit.

15:19.717 --> 15:21.007
[Lily groans]

15:21.097 --> 15:22.807
[REIN] Wait, I...
I didn't mean that.

15:22.887 --> 15:25.847
In fact, I was a shut-in
for three-- No, for five years!

15:25.927 --> 15:27.137
[LILY] Why are you lying?

15:27.227 --> 15:29.437
Are you trying
to make me madder?

15:31.937 --> 15:34.777
That one guy,
he seems pretty experienced.

15:34.857 --> 15:37.647
Yeah. Cornelius
and his gang are no joke.

15:37.737 --> 15:39.617
Actually, they're
one of the Beast's Fangs'

15:39.697 --> 15:40.867
top three parties.

15:40.947 --> 15:43.027
Even if we did defeat them
in a fight,

15:43.117 --> 15:45.657
-there'd be consequences.
-Really? Like what?

15:45.747 --> 15:47.497
Like war between
the Beast's Fangs

15:47.577 --> 15:48.667
and the Blue Crystals.

15:49.457 --> 15:52.127
And that's a battle
we'd have no chance of winning.

15:54.757 --> 15:56.877
We'll just have to
put up with them

15:56.967 --> 15:58.627
for the sake of the guild.

16:01.137 --> 16:04.137
[REIN] Lily, I guess
being an adventurer

16:04.217 --> 16:06.227
isn't all sunshine and rainbows.

16:06.307 --> 16:08.727
Between the lying and stomaching
this sort of crap,

16:08.807 --> 16:10.557
it's surprisingly tough.

16:11.767 --> 16:13.517
[REIN] Hey, what do you think
you're doing?

16:13.607 --> 16:15.437
I brought those supplies,
they're mine!

16:15.527 --> 16:18.027
They were just laying around.
How were we supposed to know?

16:18.107 --> 16:20.567
[laughter]

16:20.657 --> 16:21.867
Bright side...

16:21.947 --> 16:23.577
[SUBORDINATE] Aw, man,
look at this idiot.

16:23.657 --> 16:26.197
Bet this makes you feel good
about joining the Blue Crystals.

16:26.287 --> 16:27.867
[chatter continues indistinctly]

16:27.957 --> 16:29.537
You got that right.

16:29.997 --> 16:31.207
[gasps]

16:31.707 --> 16:33.537
You couldn't wake me up
some other way?

16:33.627 --> 16:34.587
[CORNELIUS] Morning.

16:35.247 --> 16:37.297
Just wanted to let you know
we're taking your girl with us.

16:37.377 --> 16:39.007
[REIN] Sure... What?

16:39.087 --> 16:41.797
We need something out of this
since you couldn't fix our gear.

16:41.887 --> 16:42.847
Fair is fair.

16:43.467 --> 16:46.467
Hand her over, we'll consider
the whole thing forgiven.

16:47.097 --> 16:49.097
You'll admit,
it's not a bad deal.

16:49.177 --> 16:51.227
Especially when it's
for the good of your guild

16:51.307 --> 16:52.227
and your friends.

16:52.307 --> 16:54.227
My guild and friends?

16:55.067 --> 16:57.777
If that's the case,
the choice is clear.

16:57.857 --> 16:59.027
[CORNELIUS] Huh?

16:59.107 --> 17:01.107
No way you're taking Lily.

17:01.737 --> 17:03.317
[Lily breathes shakily]

17:03.407 --> 17:06.077
[Rein yelling]

17:06.157 --> 17:07.447
[grunts]

17:07.537 --> 17:08.947
[continues yelling]

17:09.037 --> 17:10.537
[gasping]

17:10.617 --> 17:12.457
Huh? Could you stop screaming?

17:12.537 --> 17:14.247
[both gasp]

17:14.337 --> 17:15.337
[grunting]

17:16.587 --> 17:17.997
What is your deal?

17:18.087 --> 17:20.127
-Why'd you drop me like that?
-Sorry.

17:20.217 --> 17:22.467
It's my arms. They gave out.

17:22.547 --> 17:25.097
Also, you're way heavier
than I thought.

17:25.177 --> 17:27.097
I'm not heavy, your muscles
are just scrawny!

17:27.177 --> 17:28.267
[chuckles softly]

17:28.347 --> 17:29.557
[grunts]

17:30.057 --> 17:32.437
Listen, I don't care
if they order me

17:32.517 --> 17:34.307
to hand you over,
I refuse to do it.

17:34.397 --> 17:35.517
♪

17:35.607 --> 17:37.017
The entire time
you were a shut-in

17:37.107 --> 17:38.647
staying with the Blue Crystals,

17:38.727 --> 17:40.607
the guild watched over you,
right?

17:40.987 --> 17:42.987
Forget me.
If anything happened to you,

17:43.067 --> 17:44.567
they'd throw everything
they had

17:44.657 --> 17:46.447
into getting you back
no matter what.

17:46.527 --> 17:47.537
[LILY] Uh?

17:48.237 --> 17:51.367
Once Cornelius makes a decision,
he can't be swayed. So, what?

17:51.447 --> 17:54.917
I finally got my wish and became
a real-life adventurer.

17:55.377 --> 17:56.707
I want to live honestly

17:56.787 --> 17:58.627
and not have things go back
to the way they were.

17:58.707 --> 18:00.797
You're still clinging
to that dream?

18:00.877 --> 18:02.587
[CORNELIUS] Guess what, Rein?

18:02.667 --> 18:04.337
There's no point fleeing!

18:04.427 --> 18:06.467
It's not like you can
outrun my arrows!

18:06.547 --> 18:08.467
[Rein gasps softly]

18:08.557 --> 18:10.967
Guess what,
I've got something to say too!

18:11.057 --> 18:12.057
I'm not a member

18:12.137 --> 18:14.017
of the stupid Beast's Fangs
anymore!

18:14.097 --> 18:15.057
That's not all!

18:15.347 --> 18:17.227
I'm the one that dispelled
the enchantments

18:17.317 --> 18:18.977
on all your weapons!

18:19.607 --> 18:21.397
So it's your fault.

18:21.477 --> 18:23.107
[SUBORDINATE 1] This traitor
is going to suffer

18:23.187 --> 18:25.027
for making us fail our quest!

18:25.107 --> 18:26.697
[SUBORDINATE 2]
We don't need your enchantments.

18:26.777 --> 18:28.077
[SUBORDINATE 3]
Killing you will be easy.

18:28.157 --> 18:30.617
-Oh, boy.
-They're all talk.

18:30.697 --> 18:31.867
I've got special weapons

18:31.947 --> 18:33.867
that'll stop them
in their tracks.

18:33.957 --> 18:35.207
Lots of 'em.

18:36.167 --> 18:38.287
[CORNELIUS]
Does he mean those rocks?

18:38.377 --> 18:39.877
[SUBORDINATE 1]
Quit screwing around!

18:39.957 --> 18:42.087
[SUBORDINATE 2]
Like that's gonna slow us down.

18:43.967 --> 18:45.837
The pebbles he just threw...

18:45.927 --> 18:47.597
How did he make them explode?

18:47.677 --> 18:49.887
[REIN] They didn't explode,
dum-dums!

18:49.967 --> 18:52.467
I just enchanted them!
Impressive, huh?

18:52.927 --> 18:54.057
[LILY] Uh...

18:54.137 --> 18:56.557
-[both gasp]
-[CORNELIUS] Whatever...

18:57.517 --> 18:59.437
All we've gotta do
is dodge them.

18:59.857 --> 19:03.397
[screaming]

19:03.487 --> 19:06.487
Yikes. Looks like you stepped
on a small piece of one.

19:06.567 --> 19:07.617
[CORNELIUS] Uh?

19:07.697 --> 19:09.447
Sure they're deadly
if I throw them,

19:09.527 --> 19:11.237
but they still hurt
even if I don't.

19:11.827 --> 19:14.037
They're not
ordinary rocks anymore.

19:14.497 --> 19:15.867
[NARRATOR] Behold!

19:16.787 --> 19:18.707
Of all the weapons
across the world,

19:18.787 --> 19:20.497
rocks are not only the cheapest,

19:20.587 --> 19:24.007
but the most savage tool
one can use in combat.

19:24.087 --> 19:26.257
Typically, to inflict damage,

19:26.337 --> 19:28.337
stones must
be a certain size,

19:28.427 --> 19:30.137
but with Rein's enchantments,

19:30.217 --> 19:31.887
even your everyday
useless pebble

19:31.967 --> 19:34.967
can carry the explosive power
of a meteor blast.

19:35.057 --> 19:37.307
I don't believe this.

19:37.387 --> 19:39.977
[CORNELIUS] No way!
You were holding out on us?

19:40.057 --> 19:42.227
Your enchantments
can't be this powerful!

19:42.317 --> 19:44.357
They are,
but feel free to test me.

19:44.437 --> 19:46.607
It's not like
I'm running out of ammo soon.

19:47.197 --> 19:49.367
So either charge at me
and end this,

19:49.447 --> 19:51.907
or admit you lost and get lost!

19:51.987 --> 19:53.117
[grunts]

19:54.787 --> 19:56.537
[LILY]
They're heading straight home.

19:56.867 --> 19:58.247
[REIN] I need to retrieve
my bonus points

19:58.327 --> 19:59.667
back from the stones!

20:00.497 --> 20:01.377
Uh...

20:01.997 --> 20:03.167
They didn't make it.

20:03.957 --> 20:05.757
[LILY]
Based on everything I've seen,

20:05.837 --> 20:07.547
you need more durable weapons.

20:07.627 --> 20:09.467
They tend to keep breaking, huh?

20:10.007 --> 20:13.177
I doubt weapons that can handle
my heat will be easy to find.

20:13.637 --> 20:16.057
Don't get me wrong,
it's a good problem to have.

20:16.137 --> 20:17.057
[LILY] Hm?

20:17.387 --> 20:19.017
I feel like a real adventurer,

20:19.097 --> 20:20.767
worrying about
what weapon I'll use next!

20:21.307 --> 20:24.067
The only thing I know
is I need to find one soon!

20:25.357 --> 20:28.067
If you're worried,
I might know a place.

20:28.777 --> 20:30.697
Somewhere you could find a sword

20:30.777 --> 20:33.197
that can endure
even your enchantments.

20:33.277 --> 20:34.407
[dragon growls]

20:35.197 --> 20:36.197
[BARRIUS] What?

20:36.287 --> 20:39.157
Repeat that back to me,
but slower.

20:39.247 --> 20:41.537
[SUBORDINATE 1]
It's exactly like we said, sir!

20:41.627 --> 20:43.287
Rein was there!

20:43.377 --> 20:46.627
That little freak caused us
to fail our quest, guildmaster!

20:46.707 --> 20:48.467
Not the enchanter.

20:48.547 --> 20:50.507
Frankly, I find that
hard to believe.

20:50.587 --> 20:52.177
-[door opens]
-[GLENDA] Believe it.

20:52.257 --> 20:54.967
I appraised their gear.
It's true.

20:56.717 --> 20:58.887
Every bonus point
on every last piece of gear

20:58.977 --> 21:01.017
has been reduced to zero.

21:01.477 --> 21:02.727
[Barrius gasps]

21:03.107 --> 21:04.517
Are you sure?

21:04.607 --> 21:05.897
How was I supposed to know

21:05.977 --> 21:07.647
he could dispel
his enchantments?

21:07.727 --> 21:10.397
What are you buffoons doing
just standing around?

21:10.487 --> 21:11.777
Get out there
and don't come back

21:11.857 --> 21:12.907
without Rein!

21:13.197 --> 21:15.987
If he's joined a new guild,
find them, too!

21:16.077 --> 21:17.287
-[ALL] Yes, ma'am.
-[running footsteps]

21:17.367 --> 21:18.327
[door opens]

21:18.407 --> 21:19.497
[door closes]

21:19.867 --> 21:22.747
-Guildmaster.
-Yes, what is it, Glenda?

21:23.287 --> 21:24.787
In this business,

21:24.877 --> 21:27.297
reputations make
or break guilds.

21:27.377 --> 21:29.587
He needs to be made
an example of.

21:29.667 --> 21:32.087
We'll show everyone
what happens to adventurers

21:32.177 --> 21:35.177
who foolishly defy
the Beast's Fangs.

21:35.507 --> 21:38.217
[REIN] How was it, Lily?
Your first quest in two years!

21:39.717 --> 21:40.977
[chuckles softly]

21:41.057 --> 21:42.977
Good, all things considered.

21:43.057 --> 21:45.687
I know! It was pretty awesome!

21:45.767 --> 21:47.647
Did those exploding rocks
damage your hearing?

21:47.727 --> 21:49.607
-That's not what I said!
-This might shock you,

21:49.687 --> 21:51.027
but I can hear
your inner thoughts.

21:51.107 --> 21:52.897
No! You can't hear
your inner thoughts!

21:52.987 --> 21:54.197
I'd never let you in my head!

21:54.277 --> 21:55.947
-You can be so annoying!
-[MARGARET] Lily...

21:56.947 --> 21:58.617
It's been a while.

21:59.867 --> 22:03.247
But it looks like you're better
and back to having fun.

22:03.327 --> 22:04.327
You...

22:04.787 --> 22:06.207
Hello, Margaret.

22:06.287 --> 22:07.417
♪

22:07.797 --> 22:08.917
[chuckles]

22:10.047 --> 22:12.587
[♪ closing theme song playing]
